## 2. Kubernetes API Path Architecture

The Kubernetes API is organized hierarchically into core and named API groups.

### API Path Taxonomy

```text
https://kubernetes.default.svc/
├── /api                          # Core (legacy) group discovery
│   └── /v1                       # Core v1 (Pods, Secrets, ConfigMaps, Services, Nodes)
│       ├── /nodes                # Cluster-scoped resources
│       ├── /namespaces           # Cluster-scoped namespaces
│       └── /namespaces/{ns}/     # Namespace-scoped resources
│           ├── /secrets          # List secrets in namespace
│           ├── /secrets/{name}   # Get specific secret
│           ├── /configmaps       # List configmaps in namespace
│           └── /pods             # List pods in namespace
└── /apis                         # Named API groups discovery
    ├── /apps/v1                  # Deployments, StatefulSets, DaemonSets
    │   └── /namespaces/{ns}/deployments
    ├── /batch/v1                 # Jobs, CronJobs
    │   └── /namespaces/{ns}/jobs
    └── /rbac.authorization.k8s.io/v1  # Roles, ClusterRoles
        └── /namespaces/{ns}/roles
```

### URL Mapping Comparison

| Resource Type | API Group & Version | Resource Path Pattern | Example URL |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Namespaces | Core (`""`), `v1` | `/api/v1/namespaces` | `/api/v1/namespaces` |
| Secrets | Core (`""`), `v1` | `/api/v1/namespaces/{ns}/secrets` | `/api/v1/namespaces/finance-secure/secrets` |
| ConfigMaps | Core (`""`), `v1` | `/api/v1/namespaces/{ns}/configmaps` | `/api/v1/namespaces/finance-secure/configmaps` |
| Pods | Core (`""`), `v1` | `/api/v1/namespaces/{ns}/pods` | `/api/v1/namespaces/default/pods` |
| Deployments | `apps`, `v1` | `/apis/apps/v1/namespaces/{ns}/deployments` | `/apis/apps/v1/namespaces/prod/deployments` |
| Jobs | `batch`, `v1` | `/apis/batch/v1/namespaces/{ns}/jobs` | `/apis/batch/v1/namespaces/prod/jobs` |

