## 4. Alternative Exploration via `kubectl proxy`

Outside of pods, you can explore the exact same API tree from your workstation without passing tokens manually by
launching a local reverse proxy:

```bash
# Start proxy in background
kubectl proxy --port=8001 &
PROXY_PID=$!

# Explore core API and namespaces directly over HTTP
curl -s http://localhost:8001/api/v1/namespaces/{{ cka_lab_api_access_namespace | default('finance-secure') }}/secrets/db-credentials | jq .data

# Terminate proxy when finished
kill "${PROXY_PID}"
```

